This class does all decisions.

Relationships (very important to say while drawing)
ParkingService uses ParkingLot
ParkingService uses SlotChoosingStrategy
ParkingService uses PricingStrategy
ParkingService creates Ticket
Ticket references Slot and Vehicle
Floor contains Slots
ParkingLot contains Floors

What you say after drawing
ParkingLot and Ticket are pure data holders.
All decision making happens in ParkingService using strategies for slot selection and pricing.
That sentence is gold.

